; ---- names of data, for the port (port/src/gen/names.h, symmap.py)
; DATA:0092 on is a table of far pointers to the records below, which
; the compiled modules reach the library's data by (LES BX,[0092]; the
; library's own routines use the addresses).
; The drawing record: the colour, a rectangle (fill_rect, draw_row,
; draw_column, draw_line; put_pixel its first corner), whether draw_entry
; clips, and to which rectangle; whether there is one page only; the
; offset of each row in a page (0F0h words).
